# Standup format

When drafting standup from `/start-day --standup`:

- **Yesterday:** Shipped merges, reviews completed, or meaningful progress (with Jira keys).
- **Today:** Top 1–3 items from ranked queue with links.
- **Blockers:** People or systems blocking progress; name who can unblock.

Keep each bullet one line. No status changes in Jira from standup draft alone.
